text:
Certainly. Let's add that Gym block to your schedule. I'll also create a 'Gym / Fitness' goal for you so you can track your time towards it.

Here's a proposal for that:

```coach-proposal
{
  "summary": "Create 'Gym / Fitness' goal and add Monday 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM block",
  "actions": [
    {
      "type": "CREATE_GOAL",
      "payload": {
        "title": "Gym / Fitness",
        "category": "HEALTH",
        "targetHours": 4,
        "description": "Regular exercise for physical well-being and energy."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "CREATE_SCHEDULE_BLOCK",
      "payload": {
        "title": "Gym",
        "startTime": "20:00",
        "endTime": "21:00",
        "dayOfWeek": 1,
        "category": "HEALTH",
        "goalId": "$ref:0"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

This will first create the goal, then add your "Gym" block to Monday from 8:00 PM to 9:00 PM, linked to that new goal.

I also noticed many of your existing schedule blocks, like "Work" and "Morning Prayer", are not linked to any goals. Would you like me to link your "Work" blocks to a new 'Work & Engineering' goal?
